Body:
It does work for me, but the configuration file should be named `opencode.jsonc` and be placed at `~/.config/opencode`. This is what I'm using currently as configuration:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "model": "github-copilot/claude-opus-4.8",
  "provider": {
    "github-copilot": {
      "models": {
        "claude-opus-4.8": {
          "options": {
            "reasoningEffort": "medium"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
